# Keep the serverless bundle small — runtime only needs:
# api/, gencheck/, contracts/, portal/, final_contract.json,
# benchmark_fees.json, requirements.txt, vercel.json
.venv*
examples
artifacts
demo
scripts
tests
*.md
# ...but the agent skill IS part of the served site — it is the /skill.md
# endpoint. Without this negation `*.md` strips it from the bundle and the
# headline "point your agent here" URL 404s in production.
!portal/static/skill.md
.git
node_modules
__pycache__
